    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to present this well maintained 3 bedroom, 1 bath semi-detached home to the market located in the highly desirable Earlsfort Development. Located within easy reach of all essential amenities such as shops, schools, restaurants and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre. This property also benefits from easy access to public transport and the M50 motorway is reachable within minutes.\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 83sq.m comprises of entrance hallway, living room and open plan kitchen/diner to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three well-proportioned bedrooms and the family bathroom. Externally you will find a lovely, low maintenance rear garden, side access and a driveway for off road parking for multiple cars. No. 23 is offered to the market in great condition throughout, further benefitting from gas central heating, double glazed windows and no onward chain. Based on constant demand within this development we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest or arrange a viewing!\n\nFeatures\nBER C\nc.83 Sq m\n3 bed, 1 bath\nNo onward chain\nWell maintained throughout\nVery sought after location\nExcellent rear garden\nClose to all amenities\nFantastic opportunity for first time buyers/growing families/investors\n\nCall today to arrange a viewing!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "James Droney"
      }
